        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-18T22:04:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can\u0027t because of the comment that was put on the Connection:\n```\n  // Opaque value filled by the GRPC server, must not\n  // be modified nor crafted.\n  bytes cookie \u003d 1;\n```\nAnd this request is crafted from python.\n\nPlus the `cookie` naming does not match the explicit `address` content we do have",
      "parentUuid": "33d350b2_db3ec468",
      "revId": "f88a0d3be6b7f5332a6b812b8b6c4b4a49322fda",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7c7bcfd6_25709863",
        "filename": "android/pandora/server/proto/pandora/hfp.proto",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 21,
