      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-19T18:20:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After a 2nd look, the enableSlc take only a bluetoothDevice in android (whatever is connection status) as it is independently set.\nIt may be usefull to keep just the address to this request and not a connection.",
      "parentUuid": "7c7bcfd6_25709863",
      "revId": "f88a0d3be6b7f5332a6b812b8b6c4b4a49322fda",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
