      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-18T09:34:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems to be similar to a `Connect`, I think we should instead trigger the `Connect` if we are not connected inside `mmi2grpc`.",
      "revId": "f88a0d3be6b7f5332a6b812b8b6c4b4a49322fda",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a0f79dfc_d69a18ee",
        "filename": "android/pandora/server/src/com/android/pandora/Hfp.kt",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 66,
      "author": {
        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-18T22:04:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean the MMI should call both method and remove this call from the hfp.kt file?\n```\nself.connection \u003d self.host.Connect(address\u003dpts_addr).connection\nself.hfp.EnableSlc(address\u003dpts_addr)\n```\n\nThe `setConnectionPolicy` is an extra step compared to connect that we need (and we don\u0027t want to do it on each connect)",
      "parentUuid": "b55a2b7f_d50dc3a7",
      "revId": "f88a0d3be6b7f5332a6b812b8b6c4b4a49322fda",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
