      "lineNbr": 66,
      "author": {
        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-19T18:20:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see.\nBut this way of implementing will conflict with any stack that does not need to do a connect before enabling slc.\nSo I am not sure is a good thing to enforce it in the mmi2grpc\n\nEnableSlc does not take a `connection` for android but only a BluetoothDevice.",
      "parentUuid": "843df59f_4af81e24",
      "revId": "f88a0d3be6b7f5332a6b812b8b6c4b4a49322fda",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
